<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net"><diagram id="Web page layers" name="Web page layers"><mxGraphModel dx="2150" dy="1760" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="2150" pageHeight="1760" background="#ffffff" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="lane0" value="Client tier" style="swimlane;horizontal=0;startSize=60;fillColor=#f5f5f5;html=1;fontStyle=1;fontSize=15;strokeColor=#232F3E;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="110" width="2090" height="230" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lane1" value="Edge and identity tier" style="swimlane;horizontal=0;startSize=60;fillColor=#e8f4f8;html=1;fontStyle=1;fontSize=15;strokeColor=#232F3E;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="340" width="2090" height="230" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lane2" value="API tier" style="swimlane;horizontal=0;startSize=60;fillColor=#f3e9f7;html=1;fontStyle=1;fontSize=15;strokeColor=#232F3E;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="570" width="2090" height="230" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lane3" value="Compute tier" style="swimlane;horizontal=0;startSize=60;fillColor=#e8f5e9;html=1;fontStyle=1;fontSize=15;strokeColor=#232F3E;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="800" width="2090" height="230" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lane4" value="Data and messaging tier" style="swimlane;horizontal=0;startSize=60;fillColor=#fff0e6;html=1;fontStyle=1;fontSize=15;strokeColor=#232F3E;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="1030" width="2090" height="230" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lane5" value="Platform tier" style="swimlane;horizontal=0;startSize=60;fillColor=#fce4ec;html=1;fontStyle=1;fontSize=15;strokeColor=#232F3E;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="1260" width="2090" height="230" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="title" value="&lt;b&gt;Over-engineered calculator web page - layers (dev and prod, us-east-2 with a global edge)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Solid arrow: request, data or deploy path. Dashed arrow: DNS, certificate, alert or call to another repository." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontSize=16;fontColor=#232F3E;fontStyle=0;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="18" width="2090" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="users" value="&lt;b&gt;Users&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Flutter Web page in the browser" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#666666;strokeWidth=1;dashed=0;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#232F3E;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="610" y="170" width="210" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="owner" value="&lt;b&gt;Owner&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;email alerts, creates users" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#666666;strokeWidth=1;dashed=0;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#232F3E;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1610" y="170" width="210" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="waf" value="&lt;b&gt;Shared WAF web ACL&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;prod only, by ARN, not in this repo" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff7e0;strokeColor=#b7791f;strokeWidth=1;dashed=1;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#232F3E;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="110" y="400" width="210" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="r53" value="&lt;b&gt;Route 53&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;A and AAAA alias records" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#b1ddf0;strokeColor=#10739e;strokeWidth=1;dashed=0;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#232F3E;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="360" y="400" width="210" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="cf" value="&lt;b&gt;CloudFront&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;OAC, TLS 1.2+, HSTS and CSP" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#b1ddf0;strokeColor=#10739e;strokeWidth=1;dashed=0;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#232F3E;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="610" y="400" width="210" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="acm" value="&lt;b&gt;ACM certificate&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;us-east-1, DNS validated" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#b1ddf0;strokeColor=#10739e;strokeWidth=1;dashed=0;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#232F3E;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="860" y="400" width="210" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="cog" value="&lt;b&gt;Cognito user pool&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;local users, confidential app client" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#b1ddf0;strokeColor=#10739e;strokeWidth=1;dashed=0;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#232F3E;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1360" y="400" width="210" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="url" value="&lt;b&gt;BFF function URL&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;/auth/* only, AWS_IAM, signed by CloudFront" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;strokeWidth=1;dashed=0;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#232F3E;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1110" y="630" width="210" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="backends" value="&lt;b&gt;Backends sls and ecs&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;other repositories, /api/v1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff7e0;strokeColor=#b7791f;strokeWidth=1;dashed=1;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#232F3E;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1860" y="630" width="210" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="bff" value="&lt;b&gt;BFF Lambda&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;login, refresh, logout; Python 3.14 arm64" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;strokeWidth=1;dashed=0;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#232F3E;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1110" y="860" width="210" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="s3" value="&lt;b&gt;S3 web bucket&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;private, versioned, compiled page" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;strokeWidth=1;dashed=0;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#232F3E;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="610" y="1090" width="210" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="sm" value="&lt;b&gt;Secrets Manager secret&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;app client secret, AWS managed key" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;strokeWidth=1;dashed=0;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#232F3E;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1110" y="1090" width="210" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="alarms" value="&lt;b&gt;Alarms and alert topics&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;BFF errors, throttles; cert 30 and 7 d" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;strokeWidth=1;dashed=0;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#232F3E;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1610" y="1090" width="210" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="gh" value="&lt;b&gt;GitHub Actions&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;OIDC role, owner guard, IAC_TOOL" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;strokeWidth=1;dashed=0;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#232F3E;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="110" y="1320" width="210" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="cfn" value="&lt;b&gt;CloudFormation / SAM&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;4 stacks, guarded change sets (dev)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;strokeWidth=1;dashed=0;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#232F3E;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="360" y="1320" width="210" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="tf" value="&lt;b&gt;Terraform (Terragrunt)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;prod owner until backlog B003" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;strokeWidth=1;dashed=0;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#232F3E;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="610" y="1320" width="210" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="art" value="&lt;b&gt;Shared artifacts bucket&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;add-ons repo, BFF package" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff7e0;strokeColor=#b7791f;strokeWidth=1;dashed=1;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#232F3E;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="860" y="1320" width="210" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="cw" value="&lt;b&gt;CloudWatch Logs&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;BFF log group, 30 d dev, 365 d prod" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;strokeWidth=1;dashed=0;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#232F3E;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1110" y="1320" width="210" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="iam" value="&lt;b&gt;IAM&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;BFF role: logs, one GetSecretValue" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;strokeWidth=1;dashed=0;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#232F3E;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1360" y="1320" width="210" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e2" value="1" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2.5;strokeColor=#232F3E;dashed=0;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;labelBorderColor=#232F3E;fontStyle=1;fontSize=14;fontColor=#232F3E;" edge="1" parent="1" source="users" target="cf"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e3" value="2" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2.5;strokeColor=#232F3E;dashed=1;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;labelBorderColor=#232F3E;fontStyle=1;fontSize=14;fontColor=#232F3E;" edge="1" parent="1" source="r53" target="cf"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e4" value="3" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2.5;strokeColor=#232F3E;dashed=1;exitX=0;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;labelBorderColor=#232F3E;fontStyle=1;fontSize=14;fontColor=#232F3E;" edge="1" parent="1" source="acm" target="cf"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e5" value="4" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2.5;strokeColor=#232F3E;dashed=0;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;labelBorderColor=#232F3E;fontStyle=1;fontSize=14;fontColor=#232F3E;" edge="1" parent="1" source="cf" target="s3"><mxGeometry x="0.6" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e6" value="5" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2.5;strokeColor=#232F3E;dashed=0;exitX=0.9;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;labelBorderColor=#232F3E;fontStyle=1;fontSize=14;fontColor=#232F3E;" edge="1" parent="1" source="cf" target="url"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="799" y="600"/><mxPoint x="1215" y="600"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e7" value="6" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2.5;strokeColor=#232F3E;dashed=0;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;labelBorderColor=#232F3E;fontStyle=1;fontSize=14;fontColor=#232F3E;" edge="1" parent="1" source="url" target="bff"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e8" value="7" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2.5;strokeColor=#232F3E;dashed=0;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;labelBorderColor=#232F3E;fontStyle=1;fontSize=14;fontColor=#232F3E;" edge="1" parent="1" source="bff" target="sm"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e9" value="8" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2.5;strokeColor=#232F3E;dashed=0;exitX=1;exitY=0.25;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=1;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;labelBorderColor=#232F3E;fontStyle=1;fontSize=14;fontColor=#232F3E;" edge="1" parent="1" source="bff" target="cog"><mxGeometry x="0.3" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1465" y="882.5"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e10" value="9" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2.5;strokeColor=#232F3E;dashed=1;exitX=0.8;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;labelBorderColor=#232F3E;fontStyle=1;fontSize=14;fontColor=#232F3E;" edge="1" parent="1" source="users" target="backends"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="778" y="140"/><mxPoint x="1965" y="140"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e11" value="10" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2.5;strokeColor=#232F3E;dashed=1;exitX=1;exitY=0.75;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.3;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;labelBorderColor=#232F3E;fontStyle=1;fontSize=14;fontColor=#232F3E;" edge="1" parent="1" source="bff" target="alarms"><mxGeometry x="-0.3" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1673" y="927.5"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e12" value="11" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2.5;strokeColor=#232F3E;dashed=1;exitX=0.7;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.7;entryY=1;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;labelBorderColor=#232F3E;fontStyle=1;fontSize=14;fontColor=#232F3E;" edge="1" parent="1" source="alarms" target="owner"><mxGeometry x="0.6" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e13" value="12" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2.5;strokeColor=#232F3E;dashed=0;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;labelBorderColor=#232F3E;fontStyle=1;fontSize=14;fontColor=#232F3E;" edge="1" parent="1" source="gh" target="cfn"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e14" value="13" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2.5;strokeColor=#232F3E;dashed=0;exitX=0.4;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=1;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;labelBorderColor=#232F3E;fontStyle=1;fontSize=14;fontColor=#232F3E;" edge="1" parent="1" source="gh" target="tf"><mxGeometry x="0.3" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="194" y="1435"/><mxPoint x="715" y="1435"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e15" value="14" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2.5;strokeColor=#232F3E;dashed=0;exitX=0.7;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=1;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;labelBorderColor=#232F3E;fontStyle=1;fontSize=14;fontColor=#232F3E;" edge="1" parent="1" source="gh" target="art"><mxGeometry x="0.5" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset"/><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="257" y="1465"/><mxPoint x="965" y="1465"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="legend" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#232F3E;strokeWidth=1;dashed=0;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#232F3E;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="1530" width="2090" height="200" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="legL" value="&lt;b&gt;Flow legend&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;[1] Users open the page over HTTPS through CloudFront. [2] Route 53 points the domain at CloudFront (DNS). [3] The us-east-1 certificate serves TLS on the custom domain.&lt;br&gt;[4] CloudFront reads the private web bucket with origin access control. [5] CloudFront sends /auth/* to the BFF function URL, signed. [6] The URL invokes the BFF.&lt;br&gt;[7] The BFF reads the app client secret once per execution environment. [8] The BFF calls Cognito with the secret hash or the secret (login, refresh, revoke).&lt;br&gt;[9] The page calls the backends of other repositories with the ID token. [10] BFF metrics feed the alarms; [11] both alert topics email the owner.&lt;br&gt;[12] GitHub Actions deploys with CloudFormation/SAM (default) after the owner guard; [13] with IAC_TOOL=terraform it runs Terragrunt; [14] it uploads the BFF package to the shared artifacts bucket." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontSize=13;fontColor=#232F3E;fontStyle=0;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1542" width="1015" height="180" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="legR" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;One tool owns an environment at a time: dev is CloudFormation-owned (stacks auth, cert, auth-bff, frontend); prod stays Terraform-owned until backlog B003, and the owner guard stops a CloudFormation deploy there.&lt;br&gt;The auth stack fills the secret from the app client attribute at deploy time; the secret has no rotation, a TLS-only resource policy and one reader role.&lt;br&gt;No VPC: the BFF reaches Cognito and Secrets Manager over their public endpoints with TLS.&lt;br&gt;The refresh token lives only in an HttpOnly cookie; ID and access tokens only in page memory.&lt;br&gt;The components view (architect_components.drawio) shows the same system as AWS resources per Region and stack." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontSize=13;fontColor=#232F3E;fontStyle=0;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1075" y="1542" width="1015" height="180" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>